          </m:mrow>
        </m:math></para>

      <media alt="A parabola on a coordinate grid. The x-axis scale is 1 and extends from negative 6 to 6. The y-axis scale is 1 and extends from negative 2 to 8.">
        <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_08_12_06_05.svg" />
      </media>
      <!--Text
      Entry Interaction Start -->
      <exercise id="exer-00005">
        <problem id="prob-00009">
          <para id="para-00027">a. Identify the <m:math display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>-intercepts of the graph.</para>

        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00009">
          <para id="para-00028">Compare your answer: </para>
          <para id="para-00029">Graph of <m:math display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
